    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to present Strawberry Lodge a lovely 4 bedroomed detached bungalow extending to approximately 123 sq m (1324 sq. ft) of well proportioned accommodation on 0.15 hectares (0.37 acres) approx of mature grounds. This beautiful family home is tastefully presented throughout with an array of wonderful features and warm, welcoming finishes ensuring that it is a home sure to impress even the most discerning purchaser. It benefits from a spacious efficient layout, bright airy rooms and an array of attractive features and finishes.\nFirmount West is a sought after location due to its attractive, yet convenient setting close to Clane village where you can avail of excellent shops, schools, church, cafes, restaurants, pubs, leisure centre and an array of sporting and recreational facilities. Commuting to Dublin city and its surrounding areas could not be easier via a frequent bus service, rail links from nearby Sallins and Maynooth combined with proximity to the M4 and M7 motorways. \nViewing of this beautiful family home is highly recommended by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.4m x 1.7m\nWith laminate flooring, alarm keypad, telephone point.\n\nLounge - 4.2m x 3.7m\nWith feature fireplace, laminate flooring, tv point.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 8.5m x 3.7m\nWith fitted oak kitchen, granite countertop, electric oven, hob, extractor hood, integrated dishwasher, tiled floor, glass panel double doors to lounge, French doors to rear.\n\nUtility Room - 2.5m x 1.5m\nWith fitted oak kitchen units, washing machine, sink unit, tiled flooring, rear door access.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.0m x 3.0m\nTo front with laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.3m x 3.0m\nTo front with laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.6m x 3.0m\nTo front with laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.6m x 3.2m\nTo back with fitted mirror front sliding wardrobes, laminate flooring.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.4m x 1.2m\nWith Triton electric shower, wc, whb, shower screen, tiled floor, tiled splashback, mirror, shaving light, extractor.\n\nBathroom - 3.3m x 1.8m\nWith Jacquzzi bath, Triton electric shower over the bath, vanity whb, wc, shower screen, shaving light, mirror, tiled floor, tiled splashback, extractor, radiator cabinet.\n\nCorridor - 7.9m x 1.2m\nWith laminate flooring, airing cupboard, attic hatch.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Constructed C 2006</li><li>Floor area 124 sq m / 1324 sq ft approx</li><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>PVC double glazed windows</li><li>Alarm ( requires servicing)</li><li>Pine 6 panel internal doors</li><li>Blinds, lightfitting</li><li>Mature grounds, Patio area, Three sheds</li><li>Convenient setting</li><li>Stira stairs to attic, Attic floored and lighting</ul>"
      },
